    "title": "VEDA recognizes Harrisonburg Economic Development at the 2026 CED Awards - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carolynn Unger ,\n1 days ago HARRISONBURG, VA (Rocktown Now) — The Virginia Economic Developers Association (VEDA) has announced the recipients of its 2026 Community Economic Development Awards (CEDA), recognizing five communities across the Commonwealth for initiatives that reportedly advance economic vitality through innovative, collaborative economic and community development programs. Harrisonburg Economic Development won the... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
